/-!
# Hironaka

Resolution of singularities for complex manifolds: principalization of coherent ideal sheaves and embedded
resolution of analytic subsets, by finite sequences of blowups with smooth centres, and the canonical resolution
of marked ideals from which they are derived.  The public statements are in the modules `Hironaka.API*`; see
`README.md`.
-/




